1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kissasia.net =

2
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,840
Why are you trying so hard to smile?

3
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:51,039
Do you put this much effort

4
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,400
into everything you do?

5
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:02,680
Breaking up too.

6
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,080
Ruan.

7
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,280
We're sending you to your alma mater,

8
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,240
Hundred Islands University,

9
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,319
to give a presentation.

10
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:31,919
This is part

11
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,400
of your pre-return-to-flight duties.

12
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,159
Okay, Mr. Wang.

13
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:43,759
Alright.

14
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,680
We're here. Let's get out.

15
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,920
Hello.

16
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,639
Welcome.

17
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:50,040
Sorry to keep you waiting.

18
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,600
No problem.

19
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,199
Such a hot day.

20
00:04:52,199 --> 00:04:53,000
Great work, everyone.

21
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:55,879
Long time no see.

22
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,720
Long time no see.

23
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,600
Xie Yu?

24
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:00,920
When I first saw

25
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,839
the list of speakers,

26
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:02,360
I wondered

27
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,360
if it might be

28
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,199
the Ruan Sixian I know.

29
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,040
But your name's

30
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,040
probably hard to duplicate.

31
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:07,879
So I figured it was you.

32
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,600
I didn't even recognize you

33
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,600
in the crowd of students.

34
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,839
Thought you were

35
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,720
a student rep.

36
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,920
And with you in that uniform,

37
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,000
I almost didn't recognize you either.

38
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:16,480
So?

39
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,600
How does it feel to be back here?

40
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:19,959
Nervous.

41
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:21,360
No way.

42
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,319
You fly planes.

43
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,600
Still nervous about a little thing like this?

44
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,639
It's different.

45
00:05:25,879 --> 00:05:26,720
Then let's do it the old way.

46
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,560
I've got your back down there.

47
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,240
Kids these days

48
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,240
know way too much.

49
00:05:31,879 --> 00:05:33,000
I'm just worried I'll bomb up there

50
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,680
