51
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,839
You don't have to worry about that.

52
00:05:35,279 --> 00:05:36,600
They're all our juniors.

53
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:37,800
I've already talked to them.

54
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:47,959
Still the same taste.

55
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,360
I said I'd treat you to a nice meal.

56
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,759
And you chose this place?

57
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,240
Back in college,

58
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,480
this was a nice meal.

59
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:58,120
After every

60
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,279
drama club activity,

61
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,839
you'd bring us here.

62
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,920
I remember Nana and I

63
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,680
