00:16:03,759 --> 00:16:04,879
That's... so out of line.

335
00:16:04,879 --> 00:16:05,840
What's going on?

336
00:16:06,399 --> 00:16:07,399
That's a

337
00:16:07,399 --> 00:16:08,559
