341
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:15,519
But honestly,

342
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,360
I didn't

343
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,759
put much effort into that.

344
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,519
But I know exactly

345
00:16:21,159 --> 00:16:21,919
how much effort

346
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:23,519
and sweat

347
00:16:23,519 --> 00:16:24,840
I've put into flying.

348
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,720
It's been really tough.

349
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:32,600
Does

350
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,720
