365
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,720
I'm single too.

366
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:57,720
So

367
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,159
I don't have to balance work and family.

368
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,159
In the past,

369
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,559
