381
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:25,079
We have

382
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,640
a promotion standard for pilots.

383
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,200
To become a first officer,

384
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,240
you need to log

385
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,119
