409
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,640
But she didn't.

410
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,920
She put her daughter in full-time daycare.

411
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:18,400
She only picks her daughter up

412
00:18:18,799 --> 00:18:20,240
