414
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:22,319
She told me

415
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:23,880
sometimes when she's exhausted,

416
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:25,880
she even skips picking her daughter up.

417
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,359
Because

418
00:18:29,279 --> 00:18:30,680
only when she's well-rested

419
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:33,599
can she perform at her best

420
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,400
during flight duties.

421
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:36,319
So

422
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,440
is there balance?

423
00:18:38,279 --> 00:18:39,359
Seems like there's a little bit of

424
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:40,279
balancing going on.

425
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,400
But really, it's more about

426
00:18:43,039 --> 00:18:43,680
sacrifice.

427
00:18:44,799 --> 00:18:45,599
It's just like

428
00:18:45,599 --> 00:18:46,839
with your work and studies.

429
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,079
If you're studying for grad school,

430
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,960
you have to give up

431
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,400
some entertainment and rest time

432
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:53,160
to study.

433
00:18:54,559 --> 00:18:55,200
And she's

434
00:18:55,839 --> 00:18:57,359
put more of her energy

435
00:18:57,759 --> 00:18:59,240
into her flying career.

436
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,000
I remember something

437
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,160
