444
00:19:14,599 --> 00:19:15,799
Because this flight

445
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:16,720
might be taking them

446
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,000
to visit family,

447
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:19,279
