448
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,720
or to chase their dreams and love.

449
00:19:22,359 --> 00:19:24,279
We must get them safely

450
00:19:24,359 --> 00:19:25,599
to their destination.

451
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:26,799
That

452
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:28,720
is our highest mission

453
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:29,920
as pilots."

454
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,000
Please go ahead.

455
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:45,960
Come on, everyone.

456
00:19:46,559 --> 00:19:47,039
Come on.

457
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:50,519
Great work.

