562
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:36,480
I started missing

563
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,920
those days in flight school,

564
00:23:38,119 --> 00:23:39,240
practicing day and night.

565
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,079
Missing

566
00:23:41,839 --> 00:23:43,079
