569
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:49,440
Missing that burning passion

570
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,839
I felt every time I flew.

571
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,440
It's like

572
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:55,960
